{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Turn away from evil and do [C#]good
[B]Seek peace and pursue it day by [D#m]day
The eyes of the LORD are on the [C#]righteous
[B]His ears are open to their [D#m]cry
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The LORD [B]is near to the brokenheart[F#]ed
He [C#]saves those crushed in [D#m]spirit
